type: dataset
title: "IKEA Product Data in 50 Countries: Free Sample (1,000 products, 2026-11)"
abstract: "1,000 random articles from IKEA's UK range with their listings in every country that sells them (21,016 rows), snapshot of 2026-11-13: local prices and previous prices, price labels, names, product types, colours and measurements, variants, ratings, categories and image URLs."
